            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure provides an apparatus, wherein the apparatus comprises a memory, a cache memory, a plurality of processor cores coupled with the cache memory, a processor core of the plurality of processor cores comprising circuitry to execute instructions, including: an instruction to load data from a memory location associated with a virtual address, including to compare an address tag from the virtual address with a memory tag for the memory location to determine whether access to the memory location is authorized, wherein the access to the memory location is to be authorized when the address tag and the memory tag match; an instruction to store a memory tag for a memory location associated with the virtual address to the memory and an instruction to retrieve a memory tag for a memory location associated with a virtual address from the memory.</p>
            </abstract>
